  "findings": [
    "App State owns one observable use case and actor session. Actual App task invokes start with existing book/source/position owners; same handoff is injected into Reader dependencies and Settings.",
    "Both owner and session close exclude reentrant work across awaits. Configuration is read only after actual Journal.open acquires the existing process flock; failed decode closes the opened journal and preserves independent close errors.",
    "Explicit bounded configuration supplies public anchors and an existing Keychain persistent identity reference only. Real Bundle material, published vault namespace/generation/key lease and current peer pin are checked before usable configuration. No key/namespace/pairing or Apple authority is manufactured.",
    "Unique publish handles every rename/dir-fsync unknown acknowledgement by invalidating coordinator/vault and requiring held-flock directory sync plus actual file reload before reuse. Primary failures and status-persistence failures remain separate.",
    "Startup/foreground perform local material and original selected-file observations independently. Only explicit Settings recovery can enter the existing authenticated recovery implementation; no new transport or installation submission is introduced.",
    "Reviewed existing Settings section styles, visible state/problem wording and task cancellation wiring; five locales append the same23 keys while preserving all old bytes. Windows static parity is not a rendered UI/plutil/SDK acceptance.",
    "DEBUG lost-ack branch occurs after genuine writes/fsyncs; the prepared sixth suite still has six methods and actual SDK execution zero. It is not an actual OS-fsync fault or power-loss measurement."
  ],
