  "remaining": [
    "No App CSR/private-key enrolment/developer certificate signing/provisioning issuance or pairing authorization/import workflow exists; config consumes only genuinely published existing Vault namespace and accessible existing identity",
    "No signing preparation or installation submission button in this segment; no automatic submission, background scheduler or next completed-install renewal cycle",
    "An expired/unavailable current Bundle/profile or vault lease prevents connect and consequently authenticated recovery; expiry-safe Lookup-only construction remains unfinished",
    "No configured App/vault/Keychain/TLS positive runtime executed here; 6 tests are SDK0 definitions, not acceptance",
    "App initial BookStore and legacy synchronous load paths retain their prior performance limits; no whole library reread/repair or replacement store was added",
    "Selected owner receipts and normal-load observations do not prove kernel loaded image, actual cold launch, Apple installation authority or preservation of all user data",
    "Durable syscalls are observed API completion, not a power-loss/device-filesystem guarantee; crash windows in definitions are prepared owned states, not actual OS-kill tests",
    "SecureTransport and kSecUseAuthenticationUIFail remain public deprecated APIs; actual platform compile/handshake acceptance is a future independent gate"
